<view class="page">
  <view class="heading">
    <text class="title">社区</text>
    <text class="subtitle">交流与表达，按自己的节奏来。</text>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error" bindtap="retry">{{error}} 点击重试</view>
  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="card"><view class="empty">正在加载…</view></view>

  <block wx:else>
    <view class="card">
      <view class="row"><text class="card-title tight">最新</text><text class="tag tag-muted">尚未开放</text></view>
      <text class="muted">帖子需要先经过审核才会公开展示。</text>
      <view class="empty">暂无可展示的社区内容</view>
      <button class="button button-plain" bindtap="compose">写分享</button>
    </view>

    <view class="card">
      <text class="card-title">心情帖</text>
      <text class="muted">可以只写心情，也可以选择仅自己可见。</text>
      <view class="empty">私人心情与转发草稿尚未开放</view>
    </view>

    <view class="card">
      <text class="card-title">专业科普</text>
      <view class="empty">经审核的科普内容尚未接入</view>
    </view>
  </block>
</view>
